  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Dear VRChat Team,\n\nI would like to suggest a feature that enhances accessibility and user experience for a diverse, global audience. The feature involves adding multilingual support for world and group descriptions. Here’s how it could work:\n\nMultilingual Descriptions:\n\nAllow creators to add descriptions for their worlds and groups in multiple languages, with English being the default language.\n\nCreators can input descriptions in as many languages as they wish.\n\nUser Language Preferences:\n\nEnable users to specify the languages they understand in their profile settings.\n\nWhen viewing a world or group, users will see the description in one of the languages they understand, provided it matches one of the existing translations.\n\nThis feature would greatly improve the inclusivity and comprehension for non-English speaking users, making VRChat more welcoming and accessible.\n\nThank you for considering this enhancement.",
